    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d461">

                <pb facs="0610" n="508" xml:id="pg508"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/2178: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Reinsch</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Acting Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-04-11T18:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 11, 1919,
                                6 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received April 12,
                            10.22 a.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>My telegram of April 10th, 8 p.m.<anchor n="96" xml:id="d461-f1"/> I am informed
                    that an answer from the Minister of Finance extending the currency loan option
                    for six months was sent to the chairman of the group banks yesterday.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Reinsch</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d461-f1" n="96" xml:id="d461-f1-content">
                <p>Undoubtedly refers to undated telegram received April 10, 7.40 p.m., <ref
                        target="#pg507">p. 507</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
